      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>请将一个<strong>不超过 <span class=\"katex math inline\">100</span> 位</strong>的十六进制数转换为二进制数！</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "请将一个不超过 100 位的十六进制数转换为二进制数！"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>一个不超过 <span class=\"katex math inline\">100</span> 位的十六进制整数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "一个不超过 100 位的十六进制整数。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>该数对应的二进制数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "该数对应的二进制数。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>123456789ABCDEF</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>100100011010001010110011110001001101010111100110111101111</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                                                    <div class=\"input\">\n                                <h4>输入</h4>\n                                <pre>0</pre>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"output\">\n                                <h4>输出</h4>\n                                <pre>0</pre>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
